  <article class="ld-body">
<section><h2><span class="n">01</span>Essential cookies</h2><p>Required for the website to function &mdash; for example, remembering security and session state. These are always active and cannot be switched off.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">02</span>Functional cookies</h2><p>Remember your preferences, such as light or dark theme and saved view settings, so the experience stays consistent across visits.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">03</span>Analytics cookies</h2><p>Help us understand how the site is used in aggregate so we can improve it. Enabled only with your consent.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">04</span>Marketing cookies</h2><p>Set by embedded third-party content (such as YouTube videos) and only activated if you accept. They may be used by those third parties to build a profile of your interests.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">05</span>Managing cookies in your browser</h2><p>You can accept or decline non-essential cookies through our consent banner, and you can clear or block cookies at any time in your browser settings. Disabling some cookies may affect how parts of the site work.</p></section>
  </article>
